#1201
New Thalos protection quest~
&12Hear ye!  Hear ye!  Hear Ye!&00
A glorious tale of times long ago, but troubles that persist today!
A story of a Dragon, golden in color, with fiery breath that burns so hot
that no mortal man can stand within one hundred yards of it and survive!
A mighty protector, &10Antilanthulanu Magorious&00 was sent from the heavens above,
to protect New Thalos from all that is Evil!
&08However&00! I hear that he has gone quite rogue, and must be stopped!
Rumor has it that he has devised a great plan in taking over the great lands of
Samsera after crushing New Thalos!  He must be stopped!
Of course, not a single Hero that occupies this great city would let that
happen, &08RIGHT&00?!  Band together, your friends and allys, and save New Thalos from what may be
its final demise!  Hurry dear Hero travel to New Thalos and slay this vile
beast before Samsera is Next!
~
Return the ashes of the blasted &10golden&00 dragon to me, and for it, Samsera
and New Thalos will reward you greatly... Be a Hero, for us all!
~
