#1210
Easter Quest~
Peter Cankersore is launching all the Easter eggs into the air as we speak.  
Lease help find the Easter eggs he has scattered all around the world before
it's too late!  Keep an eye out for some very special golden eggs that Peter
stole as well.  Those are magic eggs that help make Easter possible.
~
Collect Easter eggs to give to the Mother Easter Rabbit.
~
