R GOLD 250000
The Mother Easter Rabbit carefully takes the egg and places it in her basket.
The Mother Easter Rabbit says, 'With your help and all the other searchers, we might yet save Easter!'
The Mother Easter Rabbit says, 'But we still need to find the rest of the eggs. Please keep looking!'
&10You have received 250,000 gold coins!&00
